Title: Add {{project}} ({{title}})

This adds persistent IRIs for {{title}}, an ontology published at
https://github.com/{{owner}}/{{repo}}.

- `https://w3id.org/{{project}}/...` redirects to the files of the latest release,
  and `releases/<version>/...` to the files at tag `v<version>`.
- Maintainers: {{maintainers}}.

The redirects were generated by the OwlTester release builder; the IRIs follow the
ontology's own ontology and version IRIs.
